From: Oussama Benjelloun <benje.oussama@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 14:25:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] HIP: AMDGPU device codegen, in-process lld link,
 code-object test

CodeGen_AMDGPU_Dev lowers Halide GPU kernels to amdgcn-amd-amdhsa
(amdgpu_kernel CC, addrspace(1) buffers, dynamic-LDS shared memory,
fenced s_barrier, FP atomics metadata, COV5 by default), emits an object
and links it in-process with lld into an HSA code object (external ld.lld
fallback via HL_HIP_USE_EXTERNAL_LLD). correctness_hip_code_object
validates the produced ELF without hardware.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
